{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_05_end","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":11,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-5","storyName":"溺火","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"城里的爱布拉娜迎来了一位意料之外的客人，而城外的遗迹中，一场葬礼，同时也是塔拉传统的还火仪式，正在拉芙希妮面前举行。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_05_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_05","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["爱布拉娜","校官","莫兰","拉芙希妮","塔拉流民","严肃的守灵人","“歌唱家”","焦急的居民","担忧的居民"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#6$1","duration":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"......","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"堡垒内的仆役已经全数被我遣退，那么这脚步声......","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"......殿下。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"哦，是你呀。来找我有什么事？","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"您不问我为什么还回得来吗？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"不问。你回来了，仅此而已，我忠心的仆臣。","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"再说，你能为我带来一位什么样的客人，我心里自然有数。","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"charslot","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_01","layer":"1","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"......宵禁开始了吗？","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"刚刚开始。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"那这也不算违背了我的命令。","id":39},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_652_1#6$1","posfrom":"0,90","posto":"0,90","afrom":"0","ato":"0.6","bstart":"0.5","bend":"0.8","duration":"2","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.65","scale":"1.7","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dullthunderclap","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......失败......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":46},{"type":"subtitle","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"失败了？","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"纳斯尔纱仍在此处，我也仍在此处，谈何失败？","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......逃离......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":55},{"type":"subtitle","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"期限是夏末节。就算黑雾以不听人言闻名，这一点想必也还记得住。","id":59},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......不出所料......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":62},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......令人失望......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":63},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......不可接受......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":64},{"type":"subtitle","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"说真的，我该如何理解你的只言片语呢？","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"或者......你也觉得话语的交流，不如法术与毁灭来得直接？","id":69},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"charslot","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜话音未落，泛着冷光的枝叶就从黑雾中探出，直指她的咽喉。","id":72},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":74},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","volume":"0.5","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fireburst","volume":"1","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"text","text":"与此同时，她的枪也刺进了厚重的雾气深处，紫色的火光在其中隐约可见，只等一个念头就将雾气燃尽。","id":83},{"type":"text","text":"但枝叶毕竟并未刺进爱布拉娜的咽喉，紫火也并未在黑雾中间燃起。","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"夏末节。","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"夏末节第二天的朝阳升起之前，我们都会得到那个结果。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"至于现在......我们都不过是在虚张声势罢了，不是吗？","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"charslot","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"bgeffect","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":95},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":99},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜维持着刺入黑雾的姿势，但顷刻之后，她咽喉前的枝叶凭空消失，她枪尖的火焰也随之熄灭。","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"黑雾随即散去。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"殿下......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你还在这里啊。","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"怎么，还有事吗？关于深池？","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"既然这里只有你我，我最忠心的仆臣，我允许你再度提起这个词。","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"感谢您的宽宏，但是，不。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"帮助一个国家建立的鬼魂也仍然是鬼魂，鬼魂不应该被铭刻在历史上。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"但我的确担忧那天和我一样留在原地的几位同僚......他们现在在何处？他们是否会对您不利？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"无需担心。而且，这应当不是你冒着风险，一直留到现在的原因。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"......在回来的路上，我看见了一片混乱。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"有的人越发狂躁，为了一点东西......甚至不为了什么就大打出手，而另一些人却像木偶般僵在原地......","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"仿佛他们都是......当年随我们一同对抗维多利亚人的鬼魂。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"他们也会没入黑暗吗？","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"这里毕竟是纳斯尔纱，红龙的巢穴，塔拉的首府。我怕这里发生的一切都将震动整个塔拉。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"不会。","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"......","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你看起来仍然不很信服。","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"殿下......我......","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"归根结底，我只有一个问题。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"只有这个问题，我恳请您给我一个答复。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"好，我准许你的僭越。","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"（深吸气）","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"爱布拉娜殿下，那个未来......","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"那个您曾向深池许诺，向所有塔拉人许诺的未来，那个塔拉人能自由书写自己的梦想的未来......","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"......是假的吗？","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"text","text":"校官的全身不住颤抖，连日来潜藏在心底的恐惧在一瞬间攫住了他。","id":147},{"type":"text","text":"那恐惧和自己的下场无关。他不怕像同僚那样被黑雾吞没，不怕自己因为触怒红龙而死。","id":148},{"type":"text","text":"他只怕从红龙口中听见那个自己从来不敢设想的答案。","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"绝无虚假。","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"您......","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我已经回答你了，校官。","id":155},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"红龙的声音飘渺、虚弱，却不容置疑。","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"听着这无数次指挥自己走向胜利的声音，男人的脊背缓缓挺直。","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"我相信您。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"或者......你只是没有相信以外的选择？","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"不，我相信您，相信您如同此前无数次一样，选择令人费解，甚至看起来走不通的道路，但总能将我们带到离那个理想更近的地方。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"这样的信任倒的确值得我的一声感谢了。","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"不过，纳斯尔纱城内的秩序并不需要你去维护。","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"既然你能从黑林中归来，那么你此刻就应当回到黑林中去。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"直到夏末节过去？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"没错。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"或者......","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"......","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"“清晨我走入黑林，呼唤迷雾”......","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"殿下？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"听见那黑林外传来的歌声了吗？","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"距离你出城，也就不过一次日出日落的时间......干得不错，拉芙希妮。","id":183},{"type":"dialog","id":184},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2.5","id":185},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"charslot","id":188},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":190},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":191,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"城内居然发生了这样的事？！","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"苇草，你姐姐......她究竟在谋划什么？","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我不知道。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"曾有人向我保证，她的谋划对塔拉有益而无害。可无论是她，还是替她作保的人，此刻我都无法相信。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"守灵人，已经到这份上了，你们都不帮苇草一把吗？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"......","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"她为了葬礼而来，我们也只为此才接纳她。","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"无论如何，逝者的生平我已知晓。","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"拿着这些绳结和花环，我们到外面去，葬礼就要开始了。","id":206},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"text","text":"人们收起分歧，默默站起。","id":209},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"subtitle","text":"清晨我走入黑林，呼唤迷雾♪","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":219},{"type":"subtitle","text":"踏上通往战场的路途♪","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":220},{"type":"subtitle","text":"没有笛声，没有战鼓♪","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":221},{"type":"subtitle","text":"唯有身后钟声，穿过雾中的水珠♪","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":222},{"type":"subtitle","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"所有的守灵人都低声唱着歌，手头做着不同的事情。","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"他们中有的人在装点逝者的遗体——但那也仅仅是往木匣上摆放绳结和花环罢了。","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"有的人在木匣周围架起柴草。","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"有的人则一边唱着，一边往前来参加葬礼的流民们手中分发蜡烛。","id":229},{"type":"text","text":"小小的，明亮的火光在营地各处摇曳。","id":230},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮也分到一盏。她小心地将其捧在胸前。","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"那个......","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"请讲。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"我不认识逝者，说实话也没什么重要的事情要说......但是，在我老家的葬礼上，大家都可以随便说话的。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"当然，这本就是塔拉人尊敬逝者的方式。","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"即便已经结束，生命仍然值得庆祝，更不用说生者的欢欣对死者而言即是告慰。请随意交谈。","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"我还做了一些点心......","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"也请自由分享。稍后我们也会有饮食提供给各位。","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"不过，考虑到库林先生英年早逝，又因城内变故横死，一些过度的行为还请各位克制。","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"还有，在还火的过程中，请各位听我们的安排。","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"明白。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":252},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":253},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"莫兰，你们那的葬礼是这么办的吗？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"说到底就只是停灵守夜而已，并没有这么多传统的步骤，我也不知道“还火”究竟是什么。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"反正一会儿听人家的就是了。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"苇草，你以前参加过这种仪式吗？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"（摇头）","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"是吗......","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":272},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"您是说......","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"拉芙希妮已经与守灵人会合，英雄真正的葬礼开始了。","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"“清晨我走入黑林，呼唤迷雾，踏上通往战场的路途”......这首歌你会唱吗？","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"您明知故问了。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"有多少次，我都是唱着这首歌，带着年轻人们走向战场的。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$runsand","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","duration":"1.5","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"是谁？是谁在唱歌？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"该死，好容易从黑林里逃出来，都已经走到了旧王城的遗址，怎么还是能听见这首歌？","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"难道我还没走出黑林？！","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"不，不对，是......遗迹中央的熔炉，在发出声音？","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"......","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"多美的旋律啊......","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"没有笛声，没有战鼓......","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"唯有身后钟声......穿过雾中的水珠......","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"我......","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"也许我该回去......","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"也许我想要的东西，只有现在才能看清......","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"而且我真的有资格......从纳斯尔纱逃走吗？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"charslot","id":315},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"给，艾玛，这是今天的面包。","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"多谢你还愿意分我口吃的。","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"以前你不也把吃的分我吗？就当是报恩吧。","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"可你一直盯着我手里的面包，到底......","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"......","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"（小声）克制，克制......","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"（小声）她是艾玛，她是之前曾经把面包分给你的人，你得帮她，你得——","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"（深呼吸）艾玛，我没事。","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"我只是、只是想说，你这都病了多久了，一直起不来床，接下来的日子不好过啊。","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"......","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"“没有笛声，没有战鼓”......","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1752_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的居民","text":"怎么唱起这首歌来了？","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"远处......好像有人在唱......","id":340},{"type":"dialog","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"在还火仪式开始之前，请死者的亲友致辞。","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"苇草小姐？","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我......只有一份悼词，是涅梅丝写好交给我，让我在葬礼上念的。这样可以吗？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"当然可以。请。","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“给库林......”","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......信？","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“库林，也许过不了多久，我就会和你遭遇同样的下场......”","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"charslot","id":363},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","y":"-50","id":364},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-100","xTo":"100","duration":"45","block":"false","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"subtitle","text":"库林，也许过不了多久，我就会遭遇和你同样的下场。变成紫色火焰的傀儡，然后化为灰烬。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":372},{"type":"subtitle","text":"或者，没有人给我解脱，我只能在死后无休止地煎熬下去。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":373},{"type":"subtitle","text":"但我一直记着你以前和我说过的话。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":374},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你说，你想做这个英雄。让你来做这个英雄吧。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":375},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你说，战争过后，纳斯尔纱需要一个既不是深池也不是军人，只属于我们自己的英雄。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":376},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你说几乎每一个纳斯尔纱的人，都在战争中失去了许多重要的东西。也许是恋人，也许是子女，也许是未来。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":377},{"type":"subtitle","text":"如果没有一个英雄，没有一个能理解他们，能为他们争取权利，同时又能纠正他们、告诫他们的榜样......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":378},{"type":"subtitle","text":"在战争结束，人们失去可以憎恨的对象的时候，他们会崩溃的。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":379},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我觉得你说得对，我同意了你的要求。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":380},{"type":"subtitle","text":"于是，你收养了提奥，你给失去产业的人们谋了生计，你......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":381},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你觉得一切都走在正确的路上，于是你提出了雕像的方案，你忘乎所以，自己把重负套在了自己的脖子上。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":382},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你在最后清醒了过来，但是......太晚了。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":383},{"type":"subtitle","text":"现在轮到我，替你背上这已经增殖到一个人的身躯难以承受的重担。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":384},{"type":"subtitle","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“......现在轮到我，替你背上这已经增殖到一个人的身躯难以承受的重担。”","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“别了，或者很快再见，库林。”","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“愿你我最终......”","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“在温暖的火中重逢。”","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":403},{"type":"charslot","id":404},{"type":"image","image":"59_i06","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":406},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"100","yFrom":"-70","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"55","block":"false","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"与悼词念完几乎同时，一簇火焰被投向木匣周围的柴草，整个柴堆熊熊燃烧起来。","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"人们按照守灵人的指示，在火堆旁围成一圈。","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"请用自己的眼确认，死者已在火中得享安宁，不再徘徊人间。","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"然后，请将烛火摆在离火堆尽可能近的地方，也可以直接将蜡烛投入火中，把火还给死者。","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"如果对死者有任何话要说，都请对着火焰大声说出口。无论生者赞美还是斥责，那都是记忆，都是逝者旅途中的慰藉。","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"把火还给死者之后，请不要离开，共同在此为死者守灵，直到火焰熄灭。","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"......开始吧。","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"愿你获得安息，未曾谋面的......","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"......骗子，还有英雄。","id":417},{"type":"text","text":"莫兰弯下腰，将蜡烛放在火边。火舌一瞬间就将蜡烛吞没，几乎燎着了她的手。","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"苇草，要不要离火近一点？","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"如果在场有任何一个人没资格纪念库林，那只能是我。","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"你是救不了他的。","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"莫兰？","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"当他决定要真正当一名英雄的时候，他就已经不容于红龙的那座巢穴了，不是吗？","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"无论如何，把火还给他吧。","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"让尘归尘，土归土，让死者带着我们的回忆沉睡，生者还要继续生活下去。","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"还火......","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"让死者带着我们的回忆沉睡......让生者......继续生活下去？","id":428},{"type":"dialog","id":429},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":431},{"type":"charslot","id":432},{"type":"image","id":433},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":434},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":436},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":437},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":440},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":442},{"type":"text","text":"在拉芙希妮若有所思的时间里，还过火的人们纷纷坐到离火堆更远的地方，最终手中擎着烛火的人只剩她一个。","id":443},{"type":"text","text":"她沉默着上前，将手里的烛火投入了熊熊燃烧的火堆之中。","id":444},{"type":"text","text":"死者已矣。","id":445},{"type":"text","text":"那些踌躇满志的、忘乎所以的、如梦初醒的、声嘶力竭的时刻，此刻都在火中燃尽，化作逸散的烟雾，或是沉默的灰烬。","id":446},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":448},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":449},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":450},{"type":"charslot","id":451},{"type":"background","id":452},{"type":"image","id":453}],"characters":["爱布拉娜","校官","莫兰","拉芙希妮","塔拉流民","严肃的守灵人","“歌唱家”","焦急的居民","担忧的居民"]}